{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/royerlab/kaggle-cell-tracking-competition/pulls/6","id":4448898534,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTGQNOc8AAAABCSzN5g","html_url":"https://github.com/royerlab/kaggle-cell-tracking-competition/pull/6","diff_url":"https://github.com/royerlab/kaggle-cell-tracking-competition/pull/6.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/royerlab/kaggle-cell-tracking-competition/pull/6.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/royerlab/kaggle-cell-tracking-competition/issues/6","number":6,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"docs(training): clarify max-iters as smoke-test option","user":{"login":"cjsj166","id":94033188,"node_id":"U_kgDOBZrVJA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/94033188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjsj166","html_url":"https://github.com/cjsj166","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjsj166/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjsj166/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjsj166/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjsj166/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjsj166/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjsj166/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjsj166/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjsj166/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjsj166/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Why\n\n`--max-iters` can make the meaning of an epoch ambiguous because it overrides the number of optimizer steps and cycles the loader independently of dataset size. It exists only to run quick smoke tests of the training pipeline and should not be treated as a normal training control.\n\n## What Changed\n\n- Marked `max_iters` as smoke-test-only in the training function documentation.\n- Updated the CLI help to explain that real training should leave it unset so one epoch remains one full loader pass.\n\n## Verification\n\nConfirmed that `uv run scripts/train_unet_transformer.py --help` displays the revised `--max-iters` guidance.\n","created_at":"2026-09-05T05:18:58Z","updated_at":"2026-09-05T06:26:19Z","closed_at":"2026-09-05T06:21:21Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"07cb8be988d69fa742a1d2bcb4294ff043e679fa","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/royerlab/kaggle-cell-tracking-competition/pulls/6/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/royerlab/kaggle-cell-tracking-competition/pulls/6/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/royerlab/kaggle-cell-tracking-competition/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/royerlab/kaggle-cell-tracking-competition/issues/6/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/royerlab/kaggle-cell-tracking-competition/statuses/c71439d9df528886ade64d77e157185dfac4f20e","head":{"label":"cjsj166:docs-clarify-max-iters-smoke-test","ref":"docs-clarify-max-iters-smoke-test","sha":"c71439d9df528886ade64d77e157185dfac4f20e","user":{"login":"cjsj166","id":94033188,"node_id":"U_kgDOBZrVJA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/94033188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjsj166","html_url":"https://github.com/cjsj166","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjsj166/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjsj166/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjsj166/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjsj166/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjsj166/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjsj166/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjsj166/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjsj166/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"